# Practitioner Interviews

This folder contains transcripts of interviews with construction practitioners, used for our Mid-quarter Analysis.

| File | Role | Format |
|---|---|---|
| Kevin_Chen_GC-assistant-PM.md | Assistant project manager at a small general contractor in St. Louis | Recorded interview, in Chinese and English, translated into English by the team |

- Each interviewee agreed to the recording and to sharing the transcript.
- Company names and details the interviewee asked us not to share are removed.
